# Predictive Analytics and Decision Intelligence in Pharmaceutical Drug Discovery

## 1. Project Overview

This notebook performs the initial exploration and quality assessment of a molecular dataset used for a machine learning research project in pharmaceutical drug discovery.

The broader research project investigates how predictive analytics and machine learning can support decision-making in early-stage drug discovery.

### Research Question

> How can machine learning and predictive analytics improve decision-making in early-stage pharmaceutical drug discovery?

### Objective of This Notebook

The objective of this notebook is to:

* Load the pharmaceutical molecular dataset.
* Understand the structure and characteristics of the data.
* Identify missing and duplicate records.
* Examine molecular properties.
* Analyze the target variable.
* Identify potential data-quality issues.
* Prepare the dataset for subsequent machine learning experiments.

The findings from this exploratory analysis will inform the preprocessing and modeling stages of the research project.

